description: Develop locally and obtain fresh user approval before every live deployment.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Deployment approval

- Make changes and complete focused testing locally first.
- Present the completed changes and verification, then explicitly ask whether to deploy them to the live app.
- Wait for the user's approval before each deployment. Approval for an earlier release does not authorize later releases.
- Keep Render automatic deployments disabled. Any action that triggers a production deployment, including a push when automatic deployment is enabled, requires that release's approval first.
- Requests to edit, fix, or test the app do not authorize a live deployment.
